E19_CHECK {"theorem":"BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun.normalized_frame_trace_recurrence","strict_definitional_type_check":true,"signature":"∀ {n : ℕ} {F : BfgsVerification.Vec n → ℝ} (R : BfgsVerification.AdmissibleBFGSRun n F) {r : ℕ}\n  (V : ℕ → Matrix (Fin n) (Fin r) ℝ) (T P : ℕ → BfgsVerification.Mat r) (b : ℕ → BfgsVerification.Vec r),\n  (∀ (k : ℕ), Matrix.det (P k) ≠ 0) →\n    (∀ (k : ℕ), P (k + 1) = P k * T k) →\n      (∀ (k : ℕ), V (k + 1) = V k * T k + BfgsVerification.EnergyIdentities.rectOuter (R.displacement k) (b k)) →\n        ∀ (k : ℕ),\n          R.normalizedFrameEnergy V P (k + 1) =\n            R.normalizedFrameEnergy V P k -\n                BfgsVerification.sqNorm ((P k)⁻¹.transpose.mulVec ((V k).transpose.mulVec (R.g k))) / R.q k +\n              BfgsVerification.sqNorm\n                  ((P (k + 1))⁻¹.transpose.mulVec ((V (k + 1)).transpose.mulVec (R.gradientChange k))) /\n                R.curvature k","contract":"EJob14.Contract03","axioms":["propext","Quot.sound","Classical.choice"]}
